<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>
  body { margin:0; font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif; }
  .card { width:1080px; height:1440px; box-sizing:border-box; background:#FFFFFF; padding:96px 84px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  h2 { margin:0; font-size:52px; color:#111827; }
  .decl { margin-top:56px; padding:40px 44px; background:#FFF7E6; border-left:8px solid #F59E0B; border-radius:16px; font-size:28px; line-height:2; color:#78350F; white-space:pre-line; }
  .foot { margin-top:auto; font-size:24px; color:#9CA6AF; }
</style></head><body>
<div class="card">
<h2>{{title}}</h2>
<div class="decl">{{declarations}}</div>
<p class="foot">判定层数据以核心集报告（card / summary）为准 · 本组图为体感快览</p>
</div>
</body></html>
